### Security decisions (one-line flags)
- Client never receives raw markdown HTML; server sanitizes with DOMPurify allowlist.
- `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` used only on server-sanitized output; CSP nonce still recommended.
- Endpoint validates schema (Zod), rate-limits, authenticates via HttpOnly cookie.
- All deps verified on npm registry, pinned exact versions, lockfile committed.
